<title>NETHERLANDS: BolsWessanen H1 net falls 27 percent.</title>
<headline>BolsWessanen H1 net falls 27 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half year</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     0.82 vs   1.05</p>
<p>    Net profit			    63.5  vs   87.9</p>
<p>    Interim Dividend (guilders)	0.32 vs   0.32</p>
<p>Note - BolsWessanen was expected by analysts to produce a net profit between 65.5 million and 71 million guilders.  </p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  2.25 vs   2.30</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    96.4  vs 122.4</p>
<p>    Financial charges		   15.9  vs  20.5</p>
<p>    Tax				     27.6  vs  32.3</p>
<p>    Associates income		   16.0  vs  18.3</p>
<p>    Extraordinary charges		5.4  vs   nil</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
